subckt dut (VDD VSS)
M1 (net2 net2 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net1 net2 net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net1 net1 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (net2 net1 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (net1 X VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (X net0 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Ra (VDD net0) resistor r=1k
Rb (net0 X) resistor r=1k
RS (net3 VSS) resistor r=1k
